/// * `mask` - points to 2 dimensional mask if needed if mask == NULL then
///   use a rectangle.
/// * `xl,yl` - coordinates of upper left of rectangular region in RastPort
/// * `maxx,maxy` - points to lower right of rectangular region in RastPort
