///
/// Search the BitMap starting at (x,y). Fill all adjacent pixels if they are:
/// Mode 0: not the same color as AOLPen Mode 1: the same color as the pixel at
/// (x,y) When actually doing the fill use the modes that apply to standard
/// areafill routine such as drawmodes and patterns.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `rp` - pointer to RastPort (x,y) - coordinate in BitMap to start the
///   flood fill at. mode - 0 fill all adjacent pixels searching for
