///
/// The area of memory pointed to by buffer is set up to be used by RastPort
/// routines that may need to get some memory for intermediate operations in
/// preparation to putting the graphics into the final BitMap. Tmpras is used to
/// control the usage of buffer.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `tmpras` - pointer to a TmpRas structure to be linked into a RastPort
///   buffer - pointer to a contiguous piece of chip memory. size - size in
///   bytes of buffer
///
